# Frontend build gate

Whenever you change anything under `frontend/` (or claim a frontend task is done):

1. Run the production build from `frontend/`:
   ```bash
   npm run build
   ```
   (`tsc -b && vite build` — typecheck alone is not enough.)
2. Fix any TypeScript or Vite build errors before finishing.
3. Do not say the work is complete if `npm run build` failed or was skipped.

This applies every time frontend code is modified in this repo.
